<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-LISCO'S H1 NET PROFIT SLIGHTLY DOWN.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-LISCO'S H1 NET PROFIT SLIGHTLY DOWN.</headline>
<text>
<p>VILNIUS, (Reuter) July 25 - First half 1997.</p>
<p>				    (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit		     25.2	     vs 26.47</p>
<p> Turnover			 145.01	   vs 151.82</p>
<p> Operating costs	 118.9		 vs  121.65</p>
<p> Gross profit	    26.114		vs  30.16</p>
<p> Operating profit	20.585		vs  24.921</p>
<p> Extraordinary gain    0.355		 vs  0.6</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit	   33.997		vs  28.651 </p>
<p>NOTE -- The Lithuanian Sea Shipping Company is a</p>
<p>state-run company on the A group of the Vilnius bourse. It has</p>
<p>been slated for privatisation by international tender.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
</text>
